01:43.92,0:01:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:05.65,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,君｜き#｜みへの想｜お#｜もいが高｜た#｜か鳴｜!なってComment: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:09.15,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,限｜か#｜ぎりなきチカラ生｜うまれるComment: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:12.36,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,求｜も#｜とめるならば　どこまでもComment: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:14.93,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,変｜かわらぬキズナ振｜ふりかざそうComment: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:29.24,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,君｜き#｜みと本｜ほん気｜！きで心｜＜こ#｜こ#｜ろぶつけ슴｜あった喜｜＜よ#｜ろ#｜こびもComment: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:36.55,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,笑｜わ#｜らい転｜こ#｜ろげてナミダ乾｜か#｜わかした切｜せ#｜つなさもComment: 0,0:00:36.55,0:00:43.39,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,繋｜つ#｜なぎあわせて風｜か#｜ぜの中｜な#｜か　あぁComment: 0,0:00:43.39,0:00:50.16,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,はためいているよ　高｜た#｜かく　高｜た#｜かくComment: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:53.33,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why　探｜さ#｜がすことを諦｜＜あ#｜き#｜らめたのComment: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:56.74,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why　独｜ひ#｜とり闘｜＜た#｜た#｜かい続｜つ#｜づけるのComment: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:59.64,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,ねえ　どんな未｜み来｜！ら#｜い　覚｜か#｜く悟｜！ごしたのComment: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:03.34,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,夢｜ゆ#｜めはもう手｜てにしたのComment: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:07.41,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,目｜めを閉｜とじて耳｜み#｜みを澄｜すましてComment: 0,0:01:07.41,0:01:10.85,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,探｜さ#｜がし出｜だそう　君｜き#｜みの答｜こ#｜たえをComment: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:14.05,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,道｜み#｜ちは必｜＜か#｜な#｜らず　続｜つ#｜づいているよComment: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:16.59,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,まだ見｜みたことのない海｜う#｜みへComment: 0,0:01:15.68,0:01:16.59,Kanji - Copy - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,海｜う#｜みへComment: 0,0:01:17.86,0:01:21.23,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,青｜あ#｜おく広｜ひ#｜ろい世｜せ界｜！か#｜いの果｜はてにComment: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.73,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,君｜き#｜みと還｜か#｜えるべき場｜ば所｜！しょがあるComment: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:26.53,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,僕｜ぼ#｜くたちは永｜え#｜い遠｜！えんにComment: 0,0:01:26.53,0:01:33.27,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,遠｜とおい昔｜＜む#｜か#｜し　そう決｜きめていたComment: 0,0:02:16.92,0:02:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:05.65,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,My heart throbs at the thought of youComment: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:09.15,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Limitless power surgesComment: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:12.36,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,As long as you wish,Comment: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:14.93,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We'll brandish our unchanging bondComment: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:29.24,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The joy of letting our true feelings fly at each otherComment: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:36.55,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The pain from how we laughed our heads off to dry our tearsComment: 0,0:00:36.55,0:00:43.39,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,We connect them together and in the wind AhComment: 0,0:00:43.39,0:00:50.16,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's fluttering higher and higherComment: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:53.33,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why did you give up on your search?Comment: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:56.74,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why do you keep fighting by yourself?Comment: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:59.64,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Say, what kind of future did you prepare for?Comment: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:03.34,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Have you fulfilled your dream?Comment: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:07.41,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Close your eyes and listen carefullyComment: 0,0:01:07.41,0:01:10.85,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Let's look for your answerComment: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:14.05,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,The road always continues towards the seaComment: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:16.59,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,That you've never seenComment: 0,0:01:17.86,0:01:21.23,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,At the broad, blue end of the worldComment: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.73,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,There is a place I have to return to with youComment: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:26.53,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,We will be foreverComment: 0,0:01:26.53,0:01:33.27,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,decided long ago in the pastDialogue: 0,0:01:34.21,0:01:36.58,Title,,0,0,0,,Become My ServantDialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:38.85,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Hold on a second!Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.85,0:01:43.12,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what happened at the Tea Party-chocolat?!Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:45.44,Main,,0,0,0,,It was th-the Straw Hats?!Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:50.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was a disaster! The wedding and the wedding cake were both ruined!Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.43,0:01:52.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Our plan to assassinate the Vinsmokes failed!Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.74,0:01:57.71,Main,,0,0,0,,And on top of all that, Bege has been plotting against us, and was planning to kill Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.71,0:02:03.54,Main,,0,0,0,,That damn Bege...  to think I respected him for his abilities-noir!Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.54,0:02:08.21,Main,,0,0,1,,But we still don't know anything about the explosion.Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:08.21,CaptionsBig,,500,0,280,,Eldest Daughter of  the Charlotte FamilyDialogue: 0,0:02:10.67,0:02:15.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Those fools were on the rooftops with us, so if they did it, they must've been suicidal.Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.91,0:02:17.48,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's unlikely.Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.48,0:02:21.88,Main,,0,0,0,,But at least we have solved one mystery-mour.Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:23.70,Main,,0,0,0,,During the Tea Party,Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.70,0:02:28.02,Main,,0,0,0,,all lines of communication to the venue were jammed-bon!Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.02,0:02:31.12,Main,,0,0,0,,It was probably Bege and his allies.Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.12,0:02:34.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Was there something you needed to report?Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.25,0:02:40.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, the Sun Pirates, who had been staying on the eastern coast...Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:44.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! They ran out on us! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:45.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Pekoms?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.22,0:02:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Those Fishman Pirates packed their bags and hit the road!Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.17,0:02:54.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I see... So that's why Jinbe did that.Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.19,0:02:57.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe...Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:03:02.87,Main,,0,0,0,,left the Big Mom Pirates, and joined forces with the Straw Hat crew.Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:07.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Jinbe left?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.23,0:03:10.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah... And now his actions make sense.Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.95,0:03:14.26,Main,,0,0,0,,He knew that Mama would take revenge on his friends.Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.26,0:03:17.07,Main,,0,0,0,,So in order to tell his friends and give them time to flee...Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:20.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe took back his previous request to leave.Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:23.95,Main,,0,0,0,,That sounds like Jinbe. A very thorough strategy, indeed.Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.95,0:03:25.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Katakuri!Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.58,0:03:29.25,Main,,0,0,0,,We've already sent troops after Straw Hat and Bege.Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:31.25,Main,,0,0,0,,All right.Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:34.64,Main,,0,0,0,,And another group is laying siege to Germa.Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:38.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Good... Brûlée, come with me!Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.06,0:03:43.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, Brother! Are you going to take out Straw Hat and the others?Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:45.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna make them pay!Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:49.61,Main,,0,0,0,,They abused me over and over...Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.61,0:03:52.90,Main,,0,0,0,,and made me help them try to kill Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.61,0:03:55.78,Main,,0,0,0,,That's my plan...Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:03:58.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna cut off Straw Hat's head!Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.11,0:04:03.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I've decided that it's important to get rid of him...Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.94,0:04:06.75,Main,,0,0,0,,before he becomes a true threat to Mama later down the line.Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.81,0:04:26.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Escape from the city!Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.43,0:04:27.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Smoothie!Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.39,0:04:30.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Run as far as you can!Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.41,0:04:35.77,Main,,0,0,0,,At a time like this?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.77,0:04:38.33,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Smoothie?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.32,0:04:42.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Everybody! Run!Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.54,0:04:54.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me... it's happening now?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.38,0:04:58.61,Captions,,0,0,0,,Germa KingdomDialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:05:01.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't reach Judge-sama or Ichiji-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.89,0:05:04.03,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened?Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.52,0:05:06.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:14.49,Main,,0,0,0,,The Big Mom Pirates?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:26.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is the... wedding cake?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:44.32,Main,,0,0,0,,The Queen's Hunger Pangs!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:48.65,Main,,0,0,0,,She's having another attack so soon?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:56.58,Main,,0,0,0,,She remembered that the wedding cake was destroyed, and that she didn't get to eat it!Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:05.59,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that in Mama's hand?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.59,0:06:13.18,Main,,0,0,0,,It's too late.Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.35,0:06:21.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.19,0:06:31.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Opera!Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:34.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wake up!Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:36.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me she took your lifespan!Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:37.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother!Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.82,0:06:43.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Opera stood in Mama's way to stop her!Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:47.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone stay away from Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.73,0:07:00.94,Main,,0,0,0,,We have to do something...Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.94,0:07:02.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:07.28,Main,,0,0,0,,The wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.65,0:07:22.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, hurry up! They're going to catch up to us!Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.79,0:07:24.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:29.27,Main,,0,0,0,,You're riding on Jinbe's shoulders! Don't boss us around!Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.27,0:07:31.13,Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay!Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.13,0:07:33.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Because Nami-san is so cute!Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.85,0:07:36.09,Main,,0,0,0,,So cute and delicate...Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.35,0:07:43.41,Main,,0,0,0,,The Big Mom Pirates will definitely send forces after us! We must hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.00,0:07:45.62,Main,,0,0,0,,You can count on me!Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.62,0:07:51.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Going through this area and then through the Seducing Woods is the fastest way back to the Sunny!Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.43,0:07:58.91,Main,,0,0,0,,You all know what to do!Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.91,0:08:03.97,Main,,0,0,0,,The only way to stop Mama's Hunger Pangs... is to give her the food she craves!Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.38,0:08:11.11,Main,,0,0,0,,The food we need... is the wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.11,0:08:16.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is the head chef?! He's the only person capable of remaking that cake!Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.59,0:08:19.39,Main,,0,0,0,,W-Well... Streusen-sama...Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.12,0:08:22.39,Main,,0,0,0,,saved everyone's life, but...Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:27.31,Main,,0,0,0,,his own landing was catastrophic!Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.14,0:08:35.61,Main,,0,0,0,,He needs several days to recover!Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.06,0:08:42.96,Main,,0,0,0,,If this continues, Sweet City will be destroyed! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:46.41,Main,,0,0,0,,How are we going to stop Mama?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.29,0:08:52.87,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't let her rampage here in the capital!Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.66,0:09:05.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:10.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Does he...Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.78,0:09:12.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess he's got an idea!Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:15.60,Main,,0,0,0,,That's our Perospero-sama! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:20.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama! The wedding cake...Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.81,0:09:23.43,Main,,0,0,0,,isn't gone!Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.98,0:09:30.94,Main,,0,0,0,,There was a backup cake, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.01,0:09:33.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Peros!Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:35.60,Main,,0,0,0,,No! What are you saying?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:41.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I-it was made out of carefully selected ingredients...Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.37,0:09:44.95,Main,,0,0,0,,And it's delicious enough to melt in your mouth!Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.95,0:09:48.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.60,0:09:52.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama, we'd love for you to have it...Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:56.53,Main,,0,0,0,,but... the Straw Hats stole it and ran!Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.53,0:10:01.70,Main,,0,0,0,,And now they're heading to the southwest beach in an attempt to escape!Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:05.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding...Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:08.09,Main,,0,0,0,,cake...Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.09,0:10:12.44,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! They've got it, lick!Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:15.91,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,She can still listen to some reason.Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.91,0:10:20.62,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If she goes after Straw Hat, that'll take out two birds with one stone.Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.64,0:10:26.92,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Can he convince her?Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.34,0:10:43.51,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're lying to me...Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.51,0:10:48.06,Main,,0,0,0,,you'll pay with your lifespan!Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.19,0:10:54.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Zeus!Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:56.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama?Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.48,0:11:11.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.15,0:11:24.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm screwed!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:29.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if Mama catches the Straw Hats, they don't actually have a cake!Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.26,0:11:32.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What should I do?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:32.98,Secondary,,0,0,0,,That seemed like a good plan, but...Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.77,0:11:40.38,Main,,0,0,0,,When Mama comes back, I'll be killed!Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.73,0:11:42.59,Main,,0,0,0,,But you bought us some time!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.59,0:11:46.25,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got to bake a cake now. Otherwise, this island is finished!Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:51.84,Main,,0,0,0,,No, it's impossible... Think about it, Smoothie.Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:58.43,Main,,0,0,0,,How many days do you think it took Head Chef Streusen to make that cake?Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:04.68,Main,,0,0,0,,The rare ingredients that we plundered from other countries are gone.Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:10.65,Main,,0,0,0,,And the one man who can bake it is unconscious! There will be no cake!Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.15,0:12:18.61,Main,,0,0,0,,To make matters worse... Mama didn't even get to taste the first cake at all...Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.61,0:12:20.70,Main,,0,0,0,,So this time, we'll have to provide...Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:28.83,Main,,0,0,0,,A cake that Mama's imagination has run wild with... One that she's never tasted before!Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:33.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Who in the world can make such a thing?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:36.38,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad.Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.38,0:12:38.51,Main,,0,0,0,,At best, she'll just destroy the island...Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.51,0:12:41.92,Main,,0,0,0,,But what happens beyond that... is unknown.Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:58.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to help you?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:07.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:09.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pudding-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:10.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.41,0:13:14.99,Main,,0,0,0,,The first wedding cake was a chocolate chiffon cake!Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.99,0:13:19.92,Main,,0,0,0,,When it comes to chocolate, I'm every bit as good as the head chef!Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:24.84,Main,,0,0,0,,And Sister Chiffon is an expert at making chiffon cakes!Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:28.88,Main,,0,0,0,,The two of us together can make that cake!Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:30.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that true, Pudding?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.98,0:13:35.47,Main,,0,0,0,,But Chiffon is Bege's wife! And he's our enemy now!Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:39.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll force her to do it.Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.63,0:13:41.39,Main,,0,0,0,,There's the evil Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.39,0:13:44.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Pudding-sama is acting like a thug!Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.49,0:13:49.41,Main,,0,0,0,,The truth is, the ingredients for the cake...Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.41,0:13:53.27,Main,,0,0,0,,were stored in Chocolat Town, on Cacao Island...Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.27,0:13:54.98,Main,,0,0,0,,the gateway of our territory.Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.78,0:13:59.12,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's where backup ingredients should be.Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.45,0:14:01.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Peros!Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:05.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Once Mama eliminates the Straw Hats, guide her to Chocolat Town!Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.25,0:14:08.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll end this problem!Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.46,0:14:12.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this true?! You're so helpful, Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.57,0:14:17.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji humiliated me!Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.72,0:14:20.64,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful eye!Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.32,0:14:23.65,Main,,0,0,0,,If Mama can wipe them out...Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.50,0:14:27.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to give her a reward.Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.11,0:14:33.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.61,0:14:35.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.40,0:14:38.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.30,0:14:41.26,Main,,0,0,0,,My heart just thumped...Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.26,0:14:44.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess some cutie is talking about me like always.Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.02,0:14:46.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I see the Seducing Woods!Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.74,0:14:51.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Are we gonna go into that forest again?! I hope we'll be okay.Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.96,0:14:53.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that?Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.13,0:14:58.42,Main,,0,0,0,,No, stop, Kin-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.43,0:15:00.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Kin-chan?Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:05.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow! The seam hurts-ju, Lady Tree...Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:11.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... But they'll stick together soon. Just like us!Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.48,0:15:15.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow! Take it easy.Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.45,0:15:22.58,Main,,0,0,0,,What? No! How?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.49,0:15:25.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.41,0:15:28.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.87,0:15:32.22,Main,,0,0,0,,You're alive, King Baum!Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.75,0:15:35.85,Main,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you again!Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:37.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Tree!Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:43.81,Main,,0,0,0,,G... G...Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:47.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:50.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay, you bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:52.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Kin-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:54.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Lady Tree!Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:15:59.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't look back! Go straight!Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.81,0:16:01.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.91,0:16:06.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? Nami, I thought they took Lola's Vivre Card.Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.99,0:16:09.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, they did. But I cut it in two!Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.76,0:16:11.04,Main,,0,0,0,,That's smart!Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:13.27,Main,,0,0,0,,This is fast!Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.27,0:16:17.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Since he's the master of the Seducing Woods, he can take us straight through it.Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:20.57,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Keep going to the Sunny at full speed!Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.57,0:16:21.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Go!Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:27.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are like the plague-ju! Leave this country already-ju!Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.25,0:16:28.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you say something?Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:32.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Do as Nami-san says!Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.82,0:16:43.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Our targets are right there! Take them down!Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:47.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.20,0:16:50.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Look, our enemies are behind us!Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:52.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Charge!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:55.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.12,0:16:57.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Go faster, King Baum!Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.86,0:16:59.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going as fast as I can-ju!Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.80,0:17:02.52,Main,,0,0,0,,If you get caught, I'll rip that seam!Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.52,0:17:03.93,Main,,0,0,0,,You're terrible!Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.47,0:17:10.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Something passed over our heads!Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.48,0:17:14.40,Main,,0,0,0,,That voice...Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:15.44,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.81,0:17:20.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:27.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.49,0:17:31.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.17,0:17:37.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.91,0:17:43.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, near the Juice River in Sweet City...Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:50.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, there it is! The Juice River!Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:53.46,Main,,0,0,0,,The Shark Submerge is anchored there!Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.05,0:17:55.84,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's the river...Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:00.61,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.61,0:18:03.64,Main,,0,0,0,,This river is filled with heavy cream!Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:06.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it smells good!Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.60,0:18:12.38,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks delicious! I'm gonna eat it!Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.91,0:18:15.57,Main,,0,0,0,,It's so sweet!Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.57,0:18:21.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the debris from the crumbled Whole Cake Chateau flew this far...Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:25.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Mmm! Mmm! It's so good!Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.78,0:18:29.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, what should we do...Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:30.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, Chopper-san!Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.17,0:18:38.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Yum-yum!Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.48,0:18:48.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom is getting closer!Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:51.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is Mama at the front line?Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.01,0:18:53.50,Main,,0,0,0,,But look at her... Something's wrong with Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:56.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me she's having one of her Hunger Pangs?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:19:00.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:02.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Shake her off, King Baum!Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.60,0:19:04.36,Main,,0,0,0,,That's impossible-ju!Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:12.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Taste the Spear of Elbaf...Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.23,0:19:13.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Elbaf?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.23,0:19:19.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Something's coming!Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.30,0:19:33.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Nation's Might!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.36,0:20:23.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding...Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.59,0:20:25.88,Main,,0,0,0,,cake!!Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.90,0:20:29.93,Main,,0,0,0,,That looked like the attack those Giants used!Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.93,0:20:32.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Warrior's Might!Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.85,0:20:38.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Why's that?Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.89,0:20:40.81,Main,,0,0,0,,King Baum!Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.19,0:20:49.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama! Forgive me-ju! They're forcing me to do this-ju!Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.28,0:20:56.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! She's gonna attack again! Let's get down there and fight!Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.01,0:21:00.63,Main,,0,0,0,,King Baum! Who was the girl you were with earlier? Was she your girlfriend?Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.42,0:21:05.53,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,No, stop, Kin-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.53,0:21:08.09,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Kin-chan?Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.09,0:21:09.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Kin-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:11.64,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Lady Tree!Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.13,0:21:15.03,Main,,0,0,0,,S-She's my fiancée-ju.Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.03,0:21:17.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow! Your fiancée?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.90,0:21:23.15,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right-ju! We made a promise to be together forever-ju!Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.16,0:21:25.15,Main,,0,0,0,,In that case...Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.15,0:21:27.82,Main,,0,0,0,,you must survive!Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.44,0:21:33.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Survive for her sake!Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:35.45,Main,,0,0,0,,So you can see her again!Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.21,0:21:48.07,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right-ju! I can't just give up now!Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:50.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Run, King Baum!Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.25,0:21:54.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You've got a whole life ahead of you with her!Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:58.26,Main,,0,0,0,,A life of love is waiting for you!Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.47,0:22:01.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Lady Tree!Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.73,0:22:04.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.02,0:22:06.70,Main,,0,0,0,,She's like a devil...Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.70,0:22:08.34,Main,,0,0,0,,That's our Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.34,0:22:11.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me my cake!Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.21,0:22:12.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's my turn!Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.97,0:22:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy! I have a plan!Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:18.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding...Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.31,0:22:19.91,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the plan?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.12,0:22:23.85,Main,,0,0,0,,cake!Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.85,0:22:25.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Black Ball!Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.84,0:22:33.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Lightning loves lightning.Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.49,0:22:35.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Nation's Might!Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.31,0:22:42.33,Main,,0,0,0,,That's it!Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.33,0:22:44.00,Main,,0,0,0,,He ate them!Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.00,0:22:47.23,Main,,0,0,0,,It's delicious! It's delicious! So delicious!!Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.65,0:22:51.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.61,0:22:55.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait!Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.04,0:22:57.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Zeus?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.11,0:23:00.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no, he's distracted big time...Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.60,0:23:04.52,Main,,0,0,0,,They're running into the Seducing Woods!Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.52,0:23:07.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:11.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Once we're in the woods, we'll have the upper hand!Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.80,0:23:16.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Because King Baum is...Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.43,0:23:19.64,Main,,0,0,0,,the master of those woods!Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.64,0:23:21.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It's King Baum-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.62,0:23:24.75,Main,,0,0,0,,King Baum-sama is coming!Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.75,0:23:27.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.90,0:23:34.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Awesome!Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.45,0:23:35.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my...Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:37.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You sure are something, Big Tree.Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.32,0:23:40.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Move! Move! Move!Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.34,0:23:52.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, look! There's the Sunny!Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.44,0:23:53.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:55.65,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a straight shot to the coast!Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.65,0:23:58.59,Main,,0,0,0,,That was an amazing plan, Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.59,0:24:01.64,Main,,0,0,0,,That's our Nami-swan!Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.80,0:24:09.61,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as Big Mom doesn't get back on Zeus, we can outrun them!Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.61,0:24:11.24,Main,,0,0,0,,His name is Zeus?Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.24,0:24:15.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. That cloud is part of Mama's soul...Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.24,0:24:16.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm Zeus.Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.91,0:24:18.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Zeus-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.46,0:24:19.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Zeus!Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.40,0:24:20.04,Main,,0,0,0,,He's here!Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.04,0:24:22.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Be careful! He's powerful!Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.34,0:24:27.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, those small lightning clouds! Can I have some more?Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.15,0:24:29.28,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.49,0:24:33.35,Main,,0,0,0,,My Black Ball? Did you enjoy them?Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.35,0:24:38.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never tasted such rich clouds before! And they weren't hard to eat at all!Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.71,0:24:40.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you have more?Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.81,0:24:43.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, they taste good?Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.97,0:24:50.95,Main,,0,0,0,,It's fluffy!Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.95,0:24:54.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me, give me, more, more!Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.28,0:24:57.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cloud! Forget about that and give us a ride instead!Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.35,0:25:03.00,Main,,0,0,0,,No can do. Only Mama can ride me, because she gave me her soul.Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.00,0:25:05.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you're just a boring cloud?Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.46,0:25:07.53,Main,,0,0,0,,So boring...Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.53,0:25:10.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Zeus... in that case...Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.95,0:25:14.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Will you be my servant?Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.55,0:25:15.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.64,0:25:17.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I will!Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.39,0:25:19.63,Main,,0,0,0,,She wasn't asking you...Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.63,0:25:23.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Then you can have Black Balls to eat every single day!Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.23,0:25:27.73,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Really?! What should I do?! What should I do?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.73,0:25:30.37,Main,,0,0,0,,So you don't have any loyalty to your boss, then?Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.34,0:25:36.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I noticed earlier that you're able to completely cover the sky!Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.29,0:25:38.66,Main,,0,0,0,,That was so cool!Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.66,0:25:40.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you think so?Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.80,0:25:44.10,Main,,0,0,0,,No one's ever complemented me like that!Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.14,0:26:10.35,Main,,0,0,0,,M-Mama...Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.93,0:26:12.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.10,0:26:15.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Seducing Woods!Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.94,0:26:19.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop them!Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.37,0:26:33.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Mama's angry!Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.21,0:26:39.67,Main,,0,0,0,,They're back to being annoying again!Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.80,0:26:43.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Why can't we just smash them and keep moving forward?Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.70,0:26:45.21,Main,,0,0,0,,That won't work!Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.21,0:26:50.12,Main,,0,0,0,,During your rampage, you'll just lose all sense of direction in these woods...Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.12,0:26:54.57,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. These woods toy with a person's mind!Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.86,0:27:05.54,Main,,0,0,0,,We cannot disobey an order from the Queen-ju!Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.70,0:27:12.88,Main,,0,0,0,,But...!Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.37,0:27:17.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Lady Tree!Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.44,0:27:19.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.02,0:27:23.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Run as fast as you can, for the sake of love and the future!Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.34,0:27:27.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama gave us an order! Stop them!Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.49,0:27:29.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.36,0:27:32.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not dying here-ju!Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.24,0:27:35.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this, King Baum-sama?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.14,0:27:40.91,Main,,0,0,0,,You can do it, King Baum!Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.53,0:27:46.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Hang on tight!Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.40,0:27:47.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.09,0:27:49.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Tree! Keep moving!Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.62,0:27:52.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.96,0:27:55.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Gatling!Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.03,0:28:20.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's convenient.Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.33,0:28:26.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch, it's getting hot. What is that?Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.64,0:28:28.12,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.51,0:28:42.03,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Prometheus-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.03,0:28:44.28,Main,,0,0,0,,He's angry!Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.28,0:28:48.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, King Baum.Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.56,0:28:53.49,Main,,0,0,0,,You betrayed Mama...Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.90,0:28:57.88,Main,,0,0,0,,P-Prometheus-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.88,0:28:59.53,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hot!Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.00,0:29:02.87,Main,,0,0,0,,He's coming this way!Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.87,0:29:04.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he trying to crush us?Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.60,0:29:06.59,Main,,0,0,0,,King Baum, get away!Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.88,0:29:18.60,Main,,0,0,0,,King Baum, run! Your fiancée is waiting for you, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.36,0:29:25.96,Main,,0,0,0,,He can't move! Let's get off!Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.34,0:29:40.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.48,0:29:41.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami! This way!Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.82,0:29:42.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami-san!Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.94,0:29:44.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You-gara will get hurt, too!Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.82,0:29:46.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.45,0:30:02.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Tree!Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.04,0:30:06.75,Main,,0,0,0,,King Baum...Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.84,0:30:08.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami-san!Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.30,0:30:27.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.77,0:30:32.91,Main,,0,0,0,,What about Bege?Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.91,0:30:34.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll catch up to him soon!Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.92,0:30:37.86,Main,,0,0,1,,There's a fire in the Seducing Woods...Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.50,0:30:39.96,Captions,,0,0,170,,The Capital - Sweet CityDialogue: 0,0:30:37.86,0:30:39.95,Main,,0,0,1,,I think Mama is fighting.Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.90,0:30:44.01,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the Mirro-world. Mont d'Or!Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.01,0:30:49.07,Main,,0,0,0,,We have 10,000 soldiers who are waiting to be sent wherever you command!Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.10,0:30:49.35,Captions,,0,1010,350,,Mirro-worldDialogue: 0,0:30:51.92,0:30:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Got it. We'll be in touch.Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.88,0:30:58.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Candy! Biscuits! Nuts!Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.70,0:31:03.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Those island battleships should watch the southwest coast where the Straw Hats' ship is anchored.Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.97,0:31:06.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Do not let them set sail!Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.36,0:31:07.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.41,0:31:11.65,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys will be the first line of security...Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.65,0:31:16.84,Main,,0,0,0,,After that, I want the Tarte ships from Flavor Island and Liqueur Island...Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.84,0:31:20.53,Main,,0,0,0,,to be on standby, and ready to move.Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.53,0:31:24.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait until you hear the warning signal from the Territorial Sea Slugs.Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.05,0:31:25.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger.Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.82,0:31:33.50,Main,,0,0,0,,They won't be able to escape from our Territorial Sea Slug security network.Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.12,0:31:38.13,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Sunny - Southwest CoastDialogue: 0,0:31:38.13,0:31:40.11,Main,,0,0,0,,The woods sure are noisy...Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.11,0:31:41.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It makes sense...Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.38,0:31:49.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama's chasing them herself. They have no chance of making it here.Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.97,0:31:51.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed.Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.66,0:31:55.56,Main,,0,0,0,,In that case... why are we waiting for them here?Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.39,0:31:58.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Just in case.Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.40,0:32:07.38,Main,,0,0,0,,The Tarte Tanks are chasing us.Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.38,0:32:08.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.82,0:32:15.79,Main,,0,0,0,,We're almost to the coast! They won't catch up.Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.17,0:32:18.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.76,0:32:20.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow! You scared me!Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.00,0:32:27.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sa... I mean, Pudding! I won't show mercy, even if you are just a little girl!Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.11,0:32:31.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I need to talk to Sister Chiffon! Bring her out, right now!Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.55,0:32:35.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Sister Chiffon! Where are you?Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.35,0:32:40.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding! Why are you here?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.54,0:32:41.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Sister!Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.73,0:32:44.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I need your help!Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.94,0:32:48.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama's having another Hunger Pang attack!Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.28,0:32:51.61,Main,,0,0,0,,She's craving a wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.28,0:32:54.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Hunger Pang attack?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.47,0:32:59.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, and the wedding cake she wants is a chocolate chiffon cake!Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.24,0:33:01.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That should be enough information for you.Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.79,0:33:07.07,Main,,0,0,0,,So you need my chiffon cake.Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.07,0:33:13.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. If we combine my chocolate and your chiffon cake,Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.46,0:33:17.30,Main,,0,0,0,,we can make a wedding cake that will satisfy Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.30,0:33:21.73,Main,,0,0,0,,If we feed it to her, we can stop her rampage!Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.90,0:33:30.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Pudding...Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.73,0:33:34.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Just like Lola, I'm leaving this place.Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.40,0:33:38.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I no longer care what happens to Mama or to this country!Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.47,0:33:41.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! So just go away, Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.56,0:33:43.00,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not it...Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.09,0:33:52.96,Main,,0,0,0,,The real reason I'm doing this...Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.96,0:33:56.68,Main,,0,0,0,,isn't for Mama... or for this country!Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.75,0:34:04.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I need to stop Mama as soon as possible...Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.00,0:34:07.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, he...Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.59,0:34:11.38,Main,,0,0,0,,and his friends will be killed!Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.38,0:34:14.40,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Galaxy 9000  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 1,0:00:01.51,0:00:02.01,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.01,0:00:02.31,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.55,0:00:02.01,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.01,0:00:02.36,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.59,0:00:02.06,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,KiDialogue: 2,0:00:02.06,0:00:02.56,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,KiDialogue: 1,0:00:01.63,0:00:02.26,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,miDialogue: 2,0:00:02.2